      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Panem coeli dedit nobis Dominus:",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0001",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Panem Angelorum manducat homo.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0002",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Domine labia mea aperies.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0003",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et os meum annunciabit laudem tuam.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Deus in adjutorium meum intende.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0005",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Domine ad adjuvandum me festina. Gloria Patri, et Filio, etc.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0006",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Hymnus",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0007",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Lauda Sion Salvatorem, lauda Ducem, et Pastorem, in hymnis, et canticis. Quantum potes, tantum aude: quia major omni laude: nec laudare sufficis. Laudis thema specialis; panis vivus, et vitalis, hodie proponitur. Quem in sacra mensa coenae, turbae fratrum duodenae, datum non ambigitur.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Panem de coelo praestitisti eis Domine.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0009",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Omne delectamentum in se habentem.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0010",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ant. Dominus Jesus, in qua nocte tradebatur, accepit panem, et gratias agens, benedixit, fregit, et dixit: Accipite, et manducate: Hoc est Corpus meum, quod pro vobis tradetur: hoc facite in meam commemorationem.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0011",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Domine exaudi orationem meam.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0012",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et clamor meus ad te veniat.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0013",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Oremus,",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0014",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Deus, qui nobis sub Sacramento mirabili passionis tuae memoriam reliquisti, tribue, quaesumus, ita nos Corporis, et Sanguinis tui sacra mysteria venerari, ut redemptionis tuae fructum in nobis jugiter sentiamus. Qui vivis, et regnas cum Deo Patre in unitate Spiritus Sancti Deus, per omnia saecula saeculorum. Amen.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0015",
          "verification": "pending"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
