          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0003",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Sit laus plena, sit sonora: sit jucunda, sit decora, mentis jubilatio. Dies enim solemnis agitur, in qua mensae primae recollitur hujus institutio. In hac mensa novi Regis, novum Pascha novae legis, Phase vetus terminat. Vetustatem novitas; umbram fugat veritas, noctem lux eliminat.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Panem de coelo praestitisti etc. ut supra.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0005",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Omnem suavitatem etc.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0006",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Domine, spiritus tuus, qui descendit super te in Jordane, illuminet et confirmet nos in veritate. suavissimo de coelo praestituto, esurientes replevit bonis, fastidiosos divites dimittens inanes.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0007",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Domine exaudi, etc. ut supra.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Oratio Deus, qui nobis, etc. ut supra.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            57
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0009",
          "verification": "pending"
        }
      ]
